# How to use git
    ================= Guided step by step ==================
        1. Check what changed
            -------------------------------------------------
            git status -> we'll se modified files & new files
            -------------------------------------------------
        2. Add changes (stage them)
            -------------------------------------------------------------------
            git add .
            or git add ui.py (optional if we wanna pushed it into specific file)
            --------------------------------------------------------------------    
        3. Commit (Local save point)
            --------------------------------------------------------------------
            git commit -m "//Describe what you changed here//"
            --------------------------------------------------------------------
        4. Push to Github
            --------------------------------
            git push
            --------------------------------
    ==========================================================
# If we want to create another branch later
    ==========================================================
        git checkout -b feature-xyz
        git push -u origin feature-xyz
    ==========================================================
# If we make a mistake
    ==========================================================
        1. Undo last commit:
            -----------------------
            git reset --soft HEAD~1
            -----------------------
        2. Undo everything:
            -----------------------
            git reset --hard Head
            -----------------------
    ==========================================================